		{
			dependencies: ["18BAF1CF134CAC95"]
			description: [
				"The Stock Ticker is the network manager of the High Logistics system. It is able to read the contents of all storages in its network that are connected by Stock Links. "
				""
				"Placing a Blaze Burner next to the Stock Ticker transforms the Blaze Burner into a Stock Keeper that can keep track of Items \\& Fluids in the network and request them, delivering them to a specified address."
			]
